#errorCatcher Echo
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="$lang">
#include "head.html.inc"
<body>
<!-- Menu navbar -->
#include "nav.html.inc"
<!-- Main container -->
<div class="$global_main_container_classes">
    <div class="row">
        <!-- Gauge panel -->
        #include "livegauges.html.inc"
        <!-- Main panel -->
        <div id="${global_main_panel_id}" class="${global_main_panel_classes}">

            <h2>About</h2>
            <p>This dashboard summarises weather data logged at the
               <a href="https://www.sailingcenter.org">Milwaukee Community Sailing Center</a>
               on the shore of Lake Michigan. Conditions are sampled every few seconds and an
               archive record is written once a minute.</p>

            <h2>How it works</h2>
            <p>Sensor data flows from an
               <a href="https://docs.openmqttgateway.com/">OpenMQTTGateway</a> receiver into a
               <a href="https://mosquitto.org/">Mosquitto</a> MQTT broker, where
               <a href="https://weewx.com">WeeWX</a> consumes it via the
               <a href="https://github.com/weewx-mqtt/subscribe">weewx-mqtt/subscribe</a>
               driver. WeeWX writes archive records, generates the static pages you're reading,
               and re-publishes every loop packet via
               <a href="https://github.com/weewx-mqtt/publish">weewx-mqtt/publish</a> so the
               gauges and charts update live in your browser without polling.</p>

            <p>The dashboard uses the
               <a href="https://github.com/brewster76/fuzzy-archer">fuzzy-archer</a> skin
               (Bootstrap + Apache ECharts). The radar loop is the UW-Madison Atmospheric &amp;
               Oceanic Sciences composite for the Milwaukee region.</p>

            <h2>Source</h2>
            <p>Site customizations (location, sensors, dashboard, branding) are driven by
               YAML configuration; see the
               <a href="https://github.com/sailingcenter/weewx-mqtt">weewx-mqtt</a> repository,
               <code>sailing-center</code> branch.</p>

        </div>
    </div>
    #include "foot.html.inc"
</div>
#include "script.html.inc"
</body>
</html>
